Request, per the Fetch standard: a URL with credentials is a TypeError; a
ReadableStream body needs init.duplex ("half", the only RequestDuplex),
can't be keepalive, and needs mode cors or same-origin; and the destination,
isReloadNavigation, isHistoryNavigation, and duplex attributes (always "",
false, false, "half" outside a browser). (fetch/api/request/request-error,
request-init-stream, request-structure, request-keepalive; Deno has the same
gaps.)

diff --git a/runtime/deno/ext/fetch/23_request.js b/runtime/deno/ext/fetch/23_request.js
